      "writtenOn": "2022-01-19T10:19:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks fairly counter-intuitive. Can we simply say that NET_CAPABILITY_ENTERPRISE_ID_1 \u003d 0, and renumber ? That way we don\u0027t need to special case anything : ID1 is just always the default.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 223,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 227,
        "endChar": 9
