        "id": 1112039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-20T05:32:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t just set the value to 0. We have a bit mask, value 0 would mean that the enterpriseBitMask has first bit 1. It still will not match with a default object with this bitmask set to 0.",
